<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">-Arum</book>
  <para style="h">GALATIYAWA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amgbasho Ablusu a na Galatiyawa mboh</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatiyawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO BULUS A NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">GALATIYAWA MBOH</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">A bu Ablusu kyangwri bleh tsifa nana mi a ŋoh amgbasho ata areh, ameh ata kputuna anyi ta ka a yama nimeh amboh tufa Yeso mboh ma Galatiyawa,</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na amya Ablusu. Mya meh bu kyangwri sa tohmoh nana Yeso Kristi bleh. A bu kyangwri mboh ha kyangwri anyimbehreh ata nza a nga meh wuwana ata areh kpeh. A bu Yeso Kristi na ikpi ŋoh ata nza a seh meh meh ti tufa ŋoh. Tasa Nnoh Ada ambohroh, ata nza a yiri Yeso anyi ma kwo <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />tasa mgbiri ambohroh mboh nza ma a bu na amya ma mareh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 1:2">Mbohroh za meh tsifa na mgbiri amohnoh amboh tufa mboh nza ma a bu ma Galatiyawa.<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Andromboh alindeh tasa tuma alindeh ata Nnoh Ada ambohroh reh ta ka bu dehreh na amohnoh, tasa ata Ada ambohroh Yeso kristi, <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />ata nza a gu ikpi a ŋoh a nga mboh tsifa kpakpana ambohroh mboh reh, la ŋoh ta a sa reh a hwana nyi na agugu ata ameh ata areh, na kira Nnoh ambohroh ata nza bu Ada ambohroh, <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Nnoh ba agba, mbohroh meh ti riri ŋoh nina trina ta a yama kpeh. Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsifa Nana Anyi tse A yama kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Mya meh leh ŋara aniye ma, la ni gyuru gbo nnoh ni gbugbo ta nnoh ŋoh ata nza a fi noh na lisa alindeh ata kristi reh, tasa za la ni gyuruna tufa nnoh tsifa anyi tse ata nza bu tsifa nana ambohroh reh kpeh, <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />meh buti bleh noh zizi, tsifa nana anyi tse a yama kpeh. A bu kyangwri amboh anyi ma a kira mata a kputu nnoh, ma a kira mata a gu tsifa nana ata Kristi reh a gyuru ta a bu andromboh anyi tse. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Mya neh meh bleh noh, akyo ta kama a tsana noh tsifa anyi tse ata nza bu tsifa nana ata Mbohroh nza meh tsana noh reh kpeh. Ha ka a bu Mbohroh, ha Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi inza. Akyo ata nza a lisa dehreh, meh kwere Nnoh a nati a nga ŋoh iya ata tuma atono! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Tswanza Mbohroh timi kǝ bleh noh na kpikpi reh, nehnehreh meh nati gyuru bleh noh za: Nza akyo a leh ahwra tsifa nana anyi tse a bleh noh na ata mohnoh ni sa nyi nnoh na ambohroh reh, ŋoh reh a nati a wa iya ata tuma atono.<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Nza meh bleh tsifa amboh areh, meh bleh la kyangwri mata a kira na amya? Mma, meh kira la Nnoh ta a kira na amya. Nza meh kira la kyangwri mboh mata a nza nana amya ma reh, meh nati bu ahwra Kristi reh za kpeh.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnoh A fi Ablusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Tsifa nana ata mya nza ni bleh kyangwri mboh reh, anyi na akyo ma inziyo areh kpeh. Meh kira la mohnoh atsi amya mboh ti wina noh ata areh. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Meh sa nyi na kyangwri akyo kpeh, ha akyo ta a tsana meh kpeh; a bu ŋoh Yeso Kristi nza a tsana meh fyafya.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Ni wina noh awumu ata meh ti kǝ lisa na kpikpi reh, meh ti kǝ tre leh tufa akeki Yahudawa mboh reh. Meh tini leh fi agǝshi agba na amboh tufa Nnoh mboh, meh kira la meh ti mla mboh kwo nambri. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Ni wina noh la nimeh akeki tufa Yahudawa mboh reh, mya meh keh mgbiri ika amya Yahudawa mboh reh. Meh keh mboh kira tufa akeki Ada mbohroh reh gaga. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Nnoh neh a jiji a seh meh a gya la meh ti tufa ŋoh neh ma a hehreh a mara meh kpeh, a seh meh na lisa alindeh a ŋoh za la meh ti bu ahwra ŋoh, a bu na kuku agohsoh a ŋoh ta <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Nza a gu Amehreh ŋoh Yeso a kate meh reh, la meh ti hwra tsifa a ŋoh reh bleh kate ma amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. Meh sohroh luhu akyo kpeh, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />ha neh meh ti na Urushalima na amboh ata ma a jiji bu amboh ble tsifa nana Yeso na amya kpeh. Mya neh meh jiji na amya Arabiya, a treh feh meh kǝ gyuru ba amya Dimashku.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Ahushi atatoh nza ka a gǝga, meh kǝ ka na amya Urushalima la meh ti na ni nza Kefas nza maka a fi ŋoh la Siman Abitrusu. Meh tuma gu ibi agrumavoh a hwa atungu na a ŋoh la ta a leh a tsana meh. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Meh sohroh nza mgbiri amboh ble tsifa nana mboh reh kpeh, a bu Yakubu ma nza a bu atsini Ada reh. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Andromboh ata mya nza ni leh ŋa ba nnoh reh, a bu huru tsifa kpeh, meh leh bleh ma tohmoh Nnoh.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Nza ka a ba ma nyina neh, meh kǝ na akpo afiya Suriya tasa Kilikiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Na ameh wohroh reh, amboh tufa Yeso mboh nza ma a yama ma Yahudiya reh, ma a hehreh a nza meh na iyo amoh kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Mboh reh ma a zaka a sehreh ma a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata ta ka a leh a nga reh iya reh, a bu ŋoh nza a gyuru a leh a bleh tsifa nana Yeso ata ŋoh ta ka a leh a druhu reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />amboh tufa mboh nza ma a yama ma Yahudiya nza maka a sehreh dehreh reh, maka ariri Nnoh tsifa amya.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso A bleh reh Ma A kira na Ablusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Ahushi agrumavoh a hwa anneh nza ka a gǝga, meh gyuru na amya Urushalima. Ichi ata areh meh na Mbohroh ma Barnaba, tasa Titus za ka a wa reh. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />A bu Nnoh a tsana meh nimeh wono la meh ti na. Mya nza ni na ni niye ma a huru reh, meh na ni dohsohna na mgbiri agbugba amboh tufa mboh, meh leh tsana mboh akeki ata mya nza ni leh hwra tsifa nana bleh ma amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. Meh bleh mboh tsifa amboh areh mboh tsimoh, meh tini kira meh ti wina la ma a kira na tsifa ata mya nza ni leh bleh mboh reh. Meh kira ndohmoh amya amboh kpikpi tasa amboh nehnehreh mata a kasa wusu kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Titus ta ka a bu na amya za reh, ŋoh tana bu kyangwri Helenawa, ma a sohroh a de ŋoh ni wuwana a shimba kpanda kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Tsifa shimba kpa ata areh a hinga tsifa la ambohroh mboh amboh agugu amboh ata nza ma aniye a ba na ayuhu. Ma aniye a ba la mata a ba ba a kputu tuma ikpi ambohroh nimeh kristi la Mbohroh meh ti bu ahwra. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Mbohroh neh meh kira na andromboh ata kyangwri amboh areh nza ma a kira timi lisa reh kpeh. Tama a kira la mata a kputu tsifa nana ata a zizi mohnoh nza ni sa de noh reh. Mbohroh meh gya nnoh Tsifa nana reh alindeh. <verse eid="GAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />amboh ata tama ka a gu mboh ni kiri la ma bu andromboh reh, ha maka a bu anyi mboh, ma bu anyimbehreh na amya, Nnoh a kira mgbiri kyangwri mboh a keh mgbiri kpeh, agbugba mboh reh ma a bleh meh la meh ti sene tsifa ata mya nza ni leh tsana reh kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Mboh neh nza maka a nza la, maa a kira meh la meh ti bleh tsifa nana ma amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa kpeh, tswanza tama ka a kira Abitrusu ta a lisa ma amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh reh. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Nnoh nga ma Abitrusu kira la ta bu ŋoh kyangwri bleh tsifa nana ma amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh reh. Nnoh nga meh kira za la meh ti bu ŋoh kyangwri bleh tsifa na na na amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Yakubu tasa Abitrusu tasa Ayohana, mboh nza ma bu agbugba amboh tufa mboh reh, nza ma a nza andromboh alindeh ata Nnoh nza a lisa meh, maka a sa reh mbohroh ma Barnaba na ivoh amoh afri, la timi na na amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. Mboh na ikpi amoh mata a leh a tsana Yahudawa mboh reh. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Mboh neh ma a kira la mbohroh meh ti leh kohnoh na amboh ata ma a leh a wa iya reh, mya za meh tini leh kira meh ti lisa dehreh.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu A hwa Abitrusu Ma Antakiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Na ameh ata Abitrusu ta ka a ba Antakiya reh, mya meh hwa ŋoh ma tohmoh a ŋoh, la kpakpana a ŋoh reh a bu ma inziyo ma. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Nza ka a jiji a ba ba aniye ma Antakiya reh, Abitrusu kǝ jiji leh rya rya mboh ma amboh tufa amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh ma a huru reh. Yakubu ka a tohmoh mgbiri amboh tufa amboh anyi nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh anyi Urushalima a na Antakiya. Kyangwri mboh reh nza maka a ba ba aniye reh, Abitrusu ka a fufa ikpi a ŋoh anyi na amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. Ka za a rya rya na amoh za kpeh. Ka a nyiri Yahudawa amboh ata nza ma a kira la mata a shimba kpanda ma amboh tufa amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Mgbiri Yahudawa amboh tufa mboh nza ma a yama ma Antakiya reh za ma a lisa abibi ika ta Abitrusu nza a lisa reh, Barnaba za ka a kira tasa za ka a lisa ikata amoh reh. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Mya neh meh nza la ma a tufa aki tsifa nana ata a zizi reh kpeh, meh kǝ bleh ma Abitrusu ma tohmoh duma mboh reh nambri la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh ni bu Kyangwri Yahudawa, nnoh neh ni gyuru leh lisa tswanza noh bu Yahudawa kpeh reh, ni nati lisa lele feh si gyuru amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh mata bu Yahudawa umbo?<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />&lt;&lt;Mbohroh ma anzoh meh bu Yahudawa mboh, meh kama bu amboh ata ma bu&lt; Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh amboh kpakpana mboh.&gt; <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Mbohroh meh wina la kyangwri a nati a wina bu yehlehleh ma tohmoh Nnoh ma ikpi la a tufa amgbasho akpi Musa reh kpeh. Mbohroh za meh sa tsifa Yeso kristi reh kira la meh ti bu yehlehleh na Nnoh ma atsi nga agohsoh ambohroh ma Yeso Kristi. Meh lisa dehreh la itoh ambohroh ta a bu na kpakpana ma tohmoh Nnoh kpeh, ma atsi gya agohsoh ambohroh na Yeso Kristi, a bu ma aki tufa tsana amgbasho Musa kpeh, akyo a nati a wina bu yehlehleh na Nnoh ma aki tsana amgbasho Musa reh kpeh.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />&lt;&lt;Nza a bu dehreh, Mbohroh nza meh kira timi bu yehlehleh na ŋoh ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh, Mbohroh Yahudawa mboh za meh hunji ikpi ambohroh ma hohroh amboh kpakpana mboh reh, ata areh ka a tsana ŋoh kristi reh a kira rya tohmoh na kpakpana? ata areh a bu dehreh kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Nza meh gyuru hinga leh mina awumu ata meh ti kǝ druhu reh, mya meh tsana ikpi amya la meh bu kyangwri kputu akpi! <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />&lt;&lt;Nza a bu ma aki tsana akpi reh, mya meh ta akpi wohroh reh la meh ti hunji fene na Nnoh. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />A bu tswanza tama a kpa meh ma gbohrohgboh Mbohroh ma Yeso kristi, nehnehreh a za bu mya meh nza ni bu na fene reh kpeh, a bu ŋoh Yeso Kristi, fene ata mya nza ni bu na wohroh ma itoh amya reh, meh nvara na nga agohsoh amehreh Nnoh ata nza a kira na amya tasa za ta a gu ikpi a ŋoh a nga mboh tsifa amya. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Mya meh sohroh gu andromboh alindeh Nnoh reh gya na ni nda kpeh, Nza akyo a nati a bu na kpakpana kpeh ma tohmoh Nnoh ma aki tufa amgbasho Musa reh, a tsana la ŋoh Yeso kristi reh a kwo tsifa andromboh kpeh.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nga Agohsoh Ha Tufa Akpi Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Duduna amohnoh Galatiyawa mboh! Ka bu anyi ka a landa nnoh? Mya tini bleh noh kakende ma ikpi Yeso ata nza na a kwo ma ikpi gbohrohgboh reh. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Meh kira meh ti luhu nnoh andromboh anyimbehreh ma. Huru Nnoh a ba nnoh tsifa la tini sere nnoh tsana amgbasho Musa reh, ha la ni sere nnoh tsifa ata nza ma a bleh noh reh wina noh? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Ni bu noh duduna umbo? tini jiji bu noh ni Huru Nnoh, nehnehreh neh ni kira ti tre nnoh ni wuwana ata ikpi amohnoh ata agohsoh kyangwri? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Wohroh iya mboh ma atsetse ata nza ni wa nnoh reh a nati bu wusu ma? a nati a zohhoh dehreh? <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Nnoh ata nza nga noh Huru a ŋoh reh, nza ka a lisa awumu amboh ata shi ŋara aniye ma nimeh amohnoh reh, ni kohnoh nnoh la a ka a lisa tsifa la ni tufa nnoh tsana amgbasho Musa, ha la bu tsifa nza ni sehreh noh tsifa Yeso? <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Nza nnoh hende Ibrahim reh. Tama a ŋa nimeh amgbasho la, &lt;&lt; Ibrahim tana nga agohsoh ma Nnoh, Nnoh ka a bleh ŋoh la a tufa yehlehleh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />mohnoh kǝ wina noh la, amboh nza ma a nga agohsoh amoh a bu mboh mi ma bu alohsoh Ibrahim. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Amgbasho Nnoh a tsana la, amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh ma a nati wina hunji Nnoh ta a lisa mboh alindeh ma tomo Nnoh nimeh nga agohsoh. tsifa nana tama a bleh ma Ibrahim na kiri la,&gt;&gt; A nati anyi na anzoh kyangwri mboh nambri ma a nati a hunji te atoh.&lt;&lt; <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Bu tsifa ata areh ŋa, amboh nza ma nga agohsoh amoh ma a nati hunji te atoh tswanza nza a te atoh ma Ibrahim kyangwri nga agohsoh. <verse eid="GAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />amboh nza ma a gya agohsoh amoh na akpi reh Nnoh a nati te mboh aniye, tsifa la tama a ŋa la, akyo ata nza a shi ta a te ndohmoh ata tama ka ŋa ma amgbasho hwra akpi reh kpeh, aniye a nati a de ŋoh. <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />A bu inziyo pelele, Akyo a nati wina bu kyangwri alindeh ma tomo Nnoh ma aki tufa amgbasho Musa, tsifa la, &gt;&gt;amboh tufa aki yehlehleh ma a nati tuma ma aki a nga agohsoh&lt;&lt; <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Amgbasho akpi reh a bleh tsifa nga agohsoh kpeh; a bleh tse, la, &gt;&gt;Akyo ata nza ka tufa aki amboh ata areh nambri a nati Nvara na amboh wohroh.&lt;&lt; <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kristi a sa reh a hwana nyi na te aniye amgbasho Musa la aniye ta kama a de reh kpeh, tswanza nza ma a ŋa la: A bu aniye a de akyo wohroh ata nza ma a kohhroh ŋoh ma agbeh.&lt;&lt; <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Kristi tana a kwo ma aki wohroh la Nnoh ta a te atoh ma amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh tswanza ta ka a te ma Ibrahim. tasa nza meh nga agohsoh ma Kristi, meh kǝ nati sa Huru Nnoh ta ka a bleh a gya reh ma agohsoh a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amgbasho Akpi Musa Tasa Bleh Gya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />ambohroh mboh ta meh ti tsana noh tsifa anyi ata nza ni wina noh na tutu, la, nza akyo mboh afri ma a kira ma ikpi tsifa anyimbehreh mata ka soh ivoh, akyo za a nati gu andromboh anyi nimeh a fi a tamba ha la ta a gu andromboh anyi a fi a ka kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Nnoh tana a bleh a gya ma Ibrahim tasa amehreh a ŋoh. Amgbasho Nnoh reh a mishi a bleh kpeh la, &lt;&lt;Tasa mgbiri alohsoh a ŋoh mboh kpeh&gt;&gt; a tsana la kyangwri mboh gaga, uwa yo, ma &lt;&lt;a bleh la alohsoh anzoh&gt;&gt;wohroh nza bu kyangwri anyimbehreh, ŋoh nza a bu Kristi. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Andromboh mya nza ni bleh reh bu dehreh: Nnoh a bleh a gya a nga Ibrahim. ta ka a lisa gbigbigbi. Tsana ata amgbasho akpi reh ata ma ta ka a de a ba nyina ahushi deri anneh tasa agrumavoh ida atatoh a nati a wina gyuru bleh gya Nnoh reh anyi avoh kiri la ta bu wusu kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Ma a bleh la maka a hunji gohmoh reh anyi ma aki tsana amgbasho akpi reh neh, wohroh, bu ma hunji anyi ma aki bleh gya reh kpeh. Ibrahim neh, bu ma aki bleh gya Nnoh reh mi nza ka a nga ŋoh te atoh reh. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Nza a bu dehreh reh neh, tama a de tsifa tsana amgbasho akpi reh a ba tsifa umbo? ma a gu tsifa tsana reh a fi ma ikpi ŋoh dehreh la mata a tsana kpakpana ambohroh reh kakende. tama a de a ba la ma a nati te ndohmoh na wohroh a gu a na ti a te amehreh Ibrahim mboh mata a tswa ti ba, ata tana a bu ma ikpi tsifa a ŋoh mi mata ka a bleh a gya reh. Tsana reh neh, bu mara tohmoh ata Nnoh tama a de a ba, ma ivoh kyangwri aki Nnoh tasa kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Kyangwri aki reh neh a ka shi ma atsitsifi nza a bu kyangwri afri feh. Nnoh neh ka bu ŋoh anyimbehreh ma. <verse eid="GAL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Wohroh amgbasho akpi reh la kpeh na bleh gya Nnoh reh? Uwa'wa, a bu dehreh kpeh! Mata a bleh la ma a de tsana anyi a ba ata nza a nati a de reh anvara, areh a nati tsana la ma a nati a hunji agohsoh alindeh Nnoh ma aki tufa tsana reh. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Tsifa Nnoh reh neh a bleh la, inziyo agba reh nambri ma a bu ma ivoh wuwana kpakpana la, andromboh mata ka a bleh a gya reh, ma a nati nga ma aki nga agohsoh nimeh Yeso Kristi, ma a nati wina nga ma amboh nza ma a nga agohsoh amoh. <verse eid="GAL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />La ameh tsifa nga agohsoh ta a ba reh neh, tsifa tsana amgbasho akpi reh tana a ka tswanza meh bu nimeh ida ka, feh ameh nga agohsoh sa a ba. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Tama a gu reh a gya ma ivoh tsana amgbasho akpi reh la ta a de reh a ba a te na Kristi, la ma ikpi nga agohsoh ambohroh meh ti bu amboh kpakpana kpeh ma tohmoh Nnoh. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />nehnehreh neh nza nga agohsoh ambohroh reh kǝ ba, meh za bu ma ivoh tsana amgbasho Musa reh za kpeh.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mara Nnoh mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Nambri ma amohnoh ni bu noh mara Nnoh mboh atsi nga agohsoh nimeh Yeso Kristi, <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Nambri ma amohnoh tama ka ahwra nnoh batisma ni gu nnoh agohsoh Kristi reh. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Ha ni bu Yahudawa mboh ha ni bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh, a te andromboh kpeh, ha ni bu ahwra ha ni bu ahwra kpeh. Andromboh a te kpeh. ha ni bu atsifa ha afya. Nambri ma amohnoh ni bu noh anyimbehreh la ni bu noh Yeso Kristi a ŋoh nambri ma amohnoh. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Nza ni bu noh Kristi a ŋoh neh, ni bu noh alohsoh Ibrahim reh tasa amboh de gohmoh reh ma ikpi tsifa a bleh a gya reh.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Andromboh mya nza ni bleh reh neh a bu dehreh, nza ni de gohmoh neh ni tre amehreh akehreh, nnoh tasa ahwra ni bu noh anyimbehreh, ha awumu nza ma a bu ma mgba afiya reh bu anzoh nambri. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />A nati bu ma ivoh alehmeh huhwa a ŋoh mboh tasa amboh sumu ŋoh mboh a tswa ameh alehmeh ta ka a bleh a gya reh feh. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />A bu dehreh za, na ameh ata meh ti kǝ tre bu amboh kpakpana, ti meh bu ahwra meh ivoh agugu amboh direh ma kpra agbugba mboh ata inziyo agba reh. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Ameh nza ka a ba ba a su neh, Nnoh ka a tohmoh Amehreh a ŋoh, afya a mara ŋoh, mara ŋoh nyi ma chuhu tsifa tsana amgbasho Musa, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />la ta a de nvara a ba ma amboh nza ma a bu ma chuhu tsifa tsana amgbasho Musa reh, la ta a gyuru mboh mata a bu mara Nnoh mboh yehlehleh. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />La ni bu noh amehreh mboh, Nnoh ka a tohmoh Huru Amehreh a ŋoh reh a ba nimeh agohsoh ambohroh, Huru reh ata nza a fi Nnoh la, &lt;&lt;Abba! Ada!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Nnoh ni za bu ahwra za kpeh, nnoh bu Amehreh mi; tasa nnoh nza ni bu amehreh reh, Nnoh kǝ gu nnoh te kyangwri gohmoh.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu A bu Na Kohnoh Ma Ikpi Galatiyawa Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Na amehmeh, ni sohroh wina noh Nnoh kpeh, ti ni kǝ krumusu ma nnoh amboh wusu mboh. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Nehnehreh nza ni wina noh Nnoh neh, ha mata a bleh Nnoh za a wina noh, ma a nati lisa lele ma sa bleh la meh ti gyuruna tuma ma hohroh wuwana mboh amboh ata inziyo agba areh ata nza a bu na wuwana kpeh? a bu tsifa abibi mboh mi. Mboh a te feh ni kira ti gyuru bu noh ahwra amoh mboh za? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />mohnoh ni kǝ nga nnoh ikpi amohnoh ti gya nnoh ibi mboh amboh anyi, tasa anara mboh amboh anyi, tasa ameh mboh amboh anyi, tasa ahushi mboh amboh anyi ti tufa mboh nnoh. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Andromboh nza ni kǝ lisa nnoh reh a nga meh nyiri, a tswanza iya mboh nambri ata mya nza ni wa ma ikpi amohnoh reh a bu wusu ma.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Meh kwere nnoh, ambohroh mboh, ti bu noh tswanza mya nza ni bu reh, la mya za meh tini bu tswanza mohnoh nza bu noh reh. Ni sohroh kpakpana meh noh kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Ni wina noh la meh tini hunji wuwana kpeh, a vuru meh aki meh ti kǝ de tsifa nana ata jiji ŋoh ba nnoh reh. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Bishi amya reh neh tana a bu wa aniye agba mi a ba na amohnoh, dehreh reh neh mohnoh ni sohroh rina meh noh kpeh ha la ti leke sumu meh noh kpeh. Ni de meh noh ni ivoh afri tswanza meh bu Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh nza a tohmoh anyi inza, ha tswanza ti kǝ sa nnoh Yeso Kristi na ikpi a ŋoh mi. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Ti ni nza noh nana agohsoh amohnoh na amya na ameh ata ari!, Nehnehreh neh, ŋoh nana agohsoh ata ti kǝ nza noh tsifa amya reh ka bu ma? Meh wina la, na ameh wohroh reh, ma a bu kavoh kpeh reh neh ti ni hre nnoh iyo amohnoh mboh nga meh noh! <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />nehnehreh, ni kǝ fi meh noh ma tohmoh tsifa la meh bleh noh zizi reh?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />amboh tsana ata huru tsifa amboh anyi tama la mboh mata nga noh nana agohsoh. Mboh neh ma a kira la andromboh ta a zohhoh nnoh kpeh. Ma a kira la mohnoh ti gyuru meh noh nyina, ti kǝ kira ti sehreh mboh nnoh mboh ma. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />A zohhoh mata a bu na agohsoh ika ata areh nza a bu na kohnoh alindeh mi. Ta ka a bu dehreh na tutu, la ta a bu na ameh ata mya nza ni bu na amohnoh ma kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Mara kira mya mboh, meh tswanza afiya nza a buti kpanga mara na afri. meh nati rya tohmoh na nza rina ika ata areh gu na ni te ti gyuruna nnoh ti tswa nnoh avoh Kristi reh. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />mata a bleh la meh bu na amohnoh nehnehreh meh ti tsifa na amohnoh na agba kukuna amya, tsifa amohnoh a wa meh aniye gaga!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hagar Tasa Saratu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Bleh meh noh ba anyi a kira ta a tuma ma ivoh tsana amgbasho akpi, Ni wina noh andromboh ata tsana amgbasho akpi nza a bleh reh? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Tama a ŋa ma amgbasho Nnoh la Ibrahim tana a bu na mara tsifa mboh afri, anyi akre bu ahwra tasa atsini ata anyi reh akre ba ahwra kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Amehreh a ŋoh ata afya ahwra reh tama a mara ŋoh ma aki dehreh ma; neh amehreh ŋoh ata afya nza a bu ahwra kpeh reh tama a mara ŋoh ma aki Nnoh ta ka a bleh a gya reh.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Andromboh reh nza a leh a na dehreh reh, a bu tsifa agba mi, a tsana la a bu gya aniye afri. Gya aniye na anyimbehreh ŋoh anyi Agbohgboh Sinai ka a mara mara mboh ata nza ma a nati bu ahwra mboh: wohroh nza a bu Hagar reh. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Nehnehreh Hagar reh ka bu ŋoh Agbohgboh Sinai reh ata nza na a bu ma akpo inzi Arabiya mboh reh. Bu wohroh nza na bu Akpo inzi agba Urushalima ata andrehmeh reh, tsifa la ŋoh mboh ma mara mboh ma a bu ahwra mboh. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Afiya ata anyi reh ŋoh a bu Saratu, a tswanza Urushalima ata inza. Ŋoh reh a bu ahwra kpeh, ŋoh wohroh ka a bu akre ambohroh. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Tama a ŋa ma amgbasho la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">&lt;&lt;Johjoh, nnoh afya akwri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">ata nza a mara amehreh mboh kpeh;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">te kpiriga mama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">ni nza rinana mara kpeh;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">la mara afya ata atsifa nza na a yi ŋoh ata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">ma a bu gaga a keh mara afya nza na a bu na atsifa.&lt;&lt;<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />nehnehreh ambohroh mboh, mbohroh meh kǝ bu mara Nnoh mboh ka nyi na bleh gya reh, tswanza Ishaku. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Na ameh wohroh amehreh ata nza ma a mara ma aki wusu dehreh ma reh, ka a leh a nga iya ma amehreh ata Nnoh nza na a bleh a gya reh, a treh a bu dehreh a gu a ba a te andrehmeh reh. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Tsifa Nnoh reh neh ka a bleh la umbo? &lt;&lt;Katsi afya ata nza bu ahwra reh mboh ma amehreh ŋoh, tsifa la amehreh afya ahwra a nati a mishi a gafa gohmoh mboh ma amehreh afya ata nza a bu ahwra kpeh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />A bu tsifa wohroh reh ŋa, ambohroh mboh, Mbohroh meh bu mara afya ahwra reh kpeh, Mbohroh neh meh bu mara afya ata nza a bu ahwra kpeh reh mi.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nvara Nimeh Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Kristi nga reh tuma ikpi ambohroh. La meh ti nza nana tuma ikpi ambohroh reh neh, shi wuwana nnoh te kama gyuruna na nnoh ma akpi mboh reh za kpeh.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Lisa sere meh noh! Mya Ablusu, meh bleh noh ata areh. Nza ni kira nnoh la akyo ta shimba nnoh kpanda, neh kristi a nati a za a bu na rishi na amohnoh kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Meh gyuru bleh noh za la akyo ata nza ata mata a shimba ŋoh kpanda a nati a tufa akpi reh nambri kanga. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Meh bleh noh mohnoh amboh ata nza ni nza noh la Nnoh a nati a firu kpakpana amohnoh la ni tufa nnoh akpi reh, mohnoh ni kǝ gyuruna ta nnoh kristi reh; Ni za kira ti sa nnoh nga alindeh ata Nnoh a ŋoh reh za kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Nza meh nga agohsoh ambohroh ma andromboh ata Kristi nza a lisa reh neh, huru Nnoh a nati a shingi reh meh ti bana. A bu zizi la Nnoh a nati a sa reh la meh bu yehlehleh na a ŋoh. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Mbohroh amboh ata nza meh bu na Yeso Kristi nimeh ambohroh, Nnoh a sohroh a nza la ha ma a shimba reh kpanda ha la ma a shimba reh kpeh. Andromboh ata nza a bu tsifa ma a huru a bu tsifa nga agohsoh na Kristi. Wohroh reh a ka a de kira na kyangwri mboh a ba.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Tini kǝ rya nnoh tohmoh alindeh feh, anyi ka a ha nnoh tufa aki a zizi reh. <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Akyo ata nza a ha nnoh reh, a sohroh a bu Nnoh ata nza a fi noh la ti te nnoh ahwra a ŋoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Tswanza nza ma a bleh reh, &lt;&lt;Ameh yisti shidi ma ka a de afohfohnoh a te abibi ta ashwi reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Agohsoh amya a bu anyimbehreh ma na Nnoh, la mohnoh ni nati kohnoh nnoh tswanza mya ma ikpi de kyangwri mboh na wuwana la mata tufa tsana akeki tufa amoh mboh tasa akeki lisa awumu amoh mboh reh. Nnoh a nati a de akyo ata nza a tsana aki kpakpana reh a te iya, ha ŋoh a bu kyangwri agba. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Atsi mya mboh, nza ma a bleh la meh tre leh hwra tsifa shimba kpa, ma a leh a de meh a te iya tsifa umbo? nza meh tre leh bleh tsifa shimba kpa neh, tsifa mya nza ni bleh ma ikpi gbohrohgboh reh a za a de hwa aniye a ba za kpeh <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />amboh ata nza ma a leh a nata la mata a shimba nnoh kpanda reh maka a shimba kpanda amoh mboh mata a tuma akwri! Ha, a bu yehlehleh mata a bu dehreh. <verse eid="GAL 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Tama a fi noh mohnoh atsi mboh la ti nvara nnoh; Kama gu nnoh tuma ikpi amohnoh reh ta a bu noh aki lisa awumu abibi ata inziyo kpeh, kǝ kira nnoh na itoh amohnoh ti kǝ te noh ndohmoh ma itoh amohnoh. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Akpi Musa reh nambri a bu ma ikpi kira na atohngoh anzoh tswanza ikpi anzoh. <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Nza ni leh mlana nnoh na itoh amohnoh, ti kǝ nyungwa nnoh itoh amohnoh tswanza uwo aye mboh, lisa nza noh feh, kavoh kpeh reh neh ni nati lofo nnoh itoh amohnoh nambri.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuma Nimeh Huru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Andromboh ata mya nza ni bleh reh a bu la, tuma noh tswanza huru Nnoh nza a tsana noh reh, nza ni lisa noh dehreh, ni nati sohroh tufa nnoh akeki kpakpana reh kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Akeki kpakpana reh a ka a sohroh a kira na akeki huru Nnoh kpeh, huru za a ka a sohroh a kira na akeki kpakpana reh kpeh. Akeki amboh afri areh maka a sohroh a kira na itoh amoh kpeh. A bu wohroh ŋa ni kǝ wina lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza ni kira nnoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Nza a bu huru Nnoh ŋa a bu na amohnoh, neh ni sohroh bu noh nimeh akpi reh kpeh.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Kira ata awumu ika ata itoh nza a ka a kira reh a bu inziyo ma: Tsifa leh ahohndoh, inyo tasa kira nza nana ata nza a ka a te na isa kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />Tasa tufa nnoh ata wusu, tasa amboh shifa, tasa leke itoh amoh, tasa mlana, tasa vene, tasa gofo, tasa kira ikpi, tasa gafana, tasa wuwa ikpi, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />tasa vene tasa te ifiya, tasa mgbiri kpakpana mboh dehreh za. Meh kpi nnoh ashotoh tswanza meh ti kǝ ikpi nnoh na ikpikpi reh la, amboh lisa ika wohroh ma a nati a sohroh a hunji gohmoh ma akpo afya Nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Agohsoh ata huru Nnoh nza ka a de a ba neh, a bu kira tasa nana agohsoh tasa tuma alindeh, tasa soh ivoh yira, tasa lisa alindeh, tasa wina de awumu, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />nga agba ma kyangwri mboh tasa wina de ikpi. Akpi Musa anyi a sohroh a ha awumu amboh ika ata areh kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />amboh ata nza ma a bu Yeso kristi a ŋoh maka a tufa kohnoh ikata abibi nza a kira reh za kpeh, meh za lisa awumu abibi ata agohsoh ambohroh nza a kira reh za kpeh. Mbohroh meh kǝ mla biroh kohnoh wohroh kwo ma gbohrohgboh. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />A bu huru Nnoh ŋa a nga reh fene. Nza a bu dehreh Mbohroh meh nati ta huru Nnoh ta tsana reh aki ata meh nati tufa. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Meh kama bu amboh gu ikpi ka kpeh, meh ti kama te vene na itoh ambohroh kpeh, meh ti kǝ nga itoh ambohroh gofo kpeh.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Lisa alindeh Ma Kyangwri Mboh Nambri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Atsi amya mboh, nza ma a de atohngoh amohnoh anyi a bu na kpakpana gaga, mohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh nimeh huru Nnoh te nnoh ve ti shingi nnoh akyo wohroh wa nnoh fi ba na amohnoh. Lisa nza noh feh kavoh kpeh reh neh mohnoh za ni nati hwa nnoh nimeh kpakpana. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Shingi nnoh itoh amohnoh amboh ata nza ma a bu nimeh kpakpana, ma aki wohroh nnoh nati wina tufa akpi Yeso Kristi reh. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Nza akyo ata nza a kohnoh la ŋoh a bu andromboh, ŋoh neh a sohroh a bu andromboh kpeh, a huru ikpi a ŋoh mi. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Anyi ma nimeh amohnoh ta a lisa a nza ndohmoh a ŋoh, nza a zohhoh feh sa a wina rya itoh, a sohroh a bu la nnoh nati tsara na akyo nza kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Kyangwri nambri ma a bu na ndohmoh te ŋoh. <verse eid="GAL 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Kyangwri ata nza ma a tsana ŋoh tsifa nana Yeso, ta a gafa awumu alindeh a ŋoh na kyangwri ata nza a tsana ŋoh reh. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Kama huru nnoh ikpi amohnoh kpeh, akyo a nati a wina huru Nnoh kpeh, andromboh ata nza ni biya, nnoh nati gu ba afya. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Akyo ata nza a biya nimeh inzi ata kira itoh, a nati a fira kwo ma ikpi a ŋoh; nza ni biya nnoh nimeh huru Nnoh, anyi nimeh huru Nnoh reh ni nati fira nnoh fene ata tuma atono ma inza. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Nza a bu dehreh, kama kohnoh noh ni lisa andromboh alindeh kpeh, na ameh ata nza a bu yehlehleh meh nati fira awumu ata te atoh nza meh sohroh kohhoh kpeh. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Nza a bu dehreh nza ni hunji noh aki, lisa nnoh alindeh ma kyangwri mboh nambri, zohhoh ŋoh reh a bu amboh ata nza ma a bu nimeh amboh nga agohsoh ma Yeso.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsifa Ablusu Ata Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Nza noh agbugba ŋa amgbasho ata mya nza ni ŋa ba noh na ivoh amya reh! <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a kira la ti shimba nnoh kpa reh a bu mboh ŋa ma a kira mata a tsana ikpi amoh mata a rya itoh ma ikpi tsifa amboh inziyo ŋoh. Ma a zaka a lisa dehreh reh la mata a nga mboh iya ma ikpi gbohrohgboh ata Kristi reh. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />amboh ata nza ma a shi ma ikpi bleh tsifa shimba kpa reh maka a sohroh a tufa amgbasho akpi reh kpeh, ma a zaka a kira la ti shimba nnoh kpanda la mboh mata a rya itoh la mohnoh ni bu noh amboh tufa mboh. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Mya meh nati rya itoh ma ikpi gbohrohgboh ata nza ma a kpa Yeso Kristi ma, la ma tsifa gbohrohgboh a ŋoh inziyo areh kǝ kwo meh, tasa mya meh kwo ma inziyo areh. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Tsifa shimba kpanda a sohroh a bu andromboh kpeh, ha ma a shimba kpanda ha ma a shimba kpanda kpeh; andromboh ata nza a bu tsifa ma a huru a bu tsifa lisa itoh afeh ŋoh mi. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Tuma alindeh ta a bu na akyo ata nza a tufa tsifa ata areh, tasa kyangwri Nnoh mboh nambri! <verse eid="GAL 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Ma trina ŋoh, akyo ta a kama a de meh a te iya kpeh, mya meh bu na kpra ata Yeso ma itoh amya. <verse eid="GAL 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Alindeh ata Yeso Kristi ta a bu na huru amohnoh, atsi mboh nambri. Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>